3. WORLD KERNEL INTERNAL STACK

Each world contains a deterministic runtime stack:

WORLD KERNEL STACK:

1. INPUT LAYER (portals + events)
2. GUARD LAYER (AEGIS + HALO)
3. ROUTING LAYER (ODIN local router)
4. EXECUTION LAYER (SKADI-local runtime)
5. MEMORY LAYER (local MNEMOS)
6. CONSENSUS LAYER (GNPL subset engine)
7. OUTPUT LAYER (portals back to GRID)


